# DEV-53 nightly telemetry orchestrator
# Schedule: 0 2 * * * America/Bogota (set TZ=America/Bogota on the worker)
# Prefer the Docker worker running scripts/nightly_scheduler.py; this file is the
# equivalent crontab for supercronic / host cron.
#
# Example (host):
#   0 2 * * * cd /path/to/repo/services/api && /path/to/uv run python ../../scripts/nightly_export.py
#
0 2 * * * python /workspace/scripts/nightly_export.py
